  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267d123f2d0949f71d1d442f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在每日杯、皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏、\\n宝冢纪念、天皇赏（秋）、日本杯、有马纪念中获得胜利，\\n且基础能力[智力]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "638895aac00c71169ff86ed4d5d4dd85244ec7967d792526f35d8803ca260f52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:045ad5119ebfe58b345eef0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在皋月赏、日本德比、\\n菊花赏、日本杯（资深级）中获胜，\\n且基础能力[力量]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "e605477efa3ab8297844309f27476343ba0a682399b3d449b7544c2f3fd96526",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f39dcf9a67f06be705fc656",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在樱花赏、橡树大赛、秋华赏、\\n伊丽莎白女王杯（资深级）中获胜，且\\n基础能力[毅力]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "704f4223981e5bdae4d13c6e69d90c78c8642169b6051639835512a4ba61a303",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37bc9843521fc3c3d27cd2a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从在育成中未取得GⅠ胜利的继承赛马娘处继承心意，\\n在朝日杯FS、日本杯（经典级）取得胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到480000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "69123f292f52547a70dfb221a4a5ed7675d6495b1d4cc26067548b349f22746c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af6f4b080f2c03379ef0c55a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在午式骏大祭中取得大成功\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "de6a59f8db609f58da728ec91a71caf39ab3fecd28c1eedfc750a4e7fac8ecc8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5cbd3d556fa557b1a69bd6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行演目排练，累计成功30次\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "f309041d004b1e2a3923851c10a191bef8f56684119aa551fa346ee2dab195f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8756db88ba5dfaa9cc2da7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在进度汇报会与午式骏大祭中均取得大成功\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb4800de1442328269a7f193353e97643dcd068bdfc2618c71048520084cb1fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d78bd611ec2f24205a048c9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "草地和沙土各取得胜利一次以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c7a4161458a8d43758ba8b1967829f08a450cbde32b0263f4c186ed149516d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd604e2c223954326dc1e6c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行流镝马的演目排练，成功7次\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "96f1c58f04c01efa80beccbb652dd2168587ce3cbe9b525375327f43d80407d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc227379f761bb45f983baea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行神旗争夺战的演目排练，成功7次\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b1fa9f36a192b24f810b717e756d35bbeab9559d79110b1a1adbefdaba4bbb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d58a387c973a41a33f809be8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行纳舞的演目排练，成功7次\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ba05711f33a29dec7159ea16baa784f9c6bf3d00908f902794534c91af9e3f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:979dcd4da92894396c5aae89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行大曳神舆的演目排练，成功7次\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbd12f747d3fed68baf16666872ed38848d60062e3f93656a438dc99fd469ffa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "413"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c0da65ac76600c2d1b8c21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行飞悬的演目排练，成功7次\\n※「友朋，解读青史　——午式骏大祭——」限定",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfca5f55b01b9838ef42c6e716c00f8a385970fb4dfa19ddfc5911e428c5f7c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "414"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e665233f9f4124450503eaf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加比赛10次以上，且全部比赛均在3位以内完成育成\\n（注：「ワイド」是日本马券（马彩）的一种形式，包含两匹马的号码，\\n如果这两匹马同时进入前三则中奖）",
      "source_fingerprint": "65457adfb5be724e20bb28b8cc5c734931da1e28bf140533f0cc8c26be03198f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa492885555dd3387f931d9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从育成过程中曾在橡树大赛获胜的赛马娘身上继承心意，\\n于橡树大赛、天皇赏（秋）取得胜利，\\n并且粉丝数达到320000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "917305e8f01edd19ffc5a0201a31074a087dffa5ed49fc1f36f54259ed26e52d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bc2473a59e1ed8b3862aab7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得阪神两岁雌马大赛的胜利，所有比赛都以干劲“绝好调”出战，\\n在没有过“变胖”、“皮肤粗糙”、“懒惰成性”的情况下\\n并且所有训练设施达到LV3以上完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "689ce782883e313e218831aa6d91f56d34420a28b12259aa51f1f2d90e05b203",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54c0a9ca17f1acb36516b48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加重赏比赛达到23次以上，\\n并在人气第二以上的情况下取得菊花赏、天皇赏(春)的胜利；\\n且粉丝数达到32万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd9789de0bc9ec6d2d9545417fe21474f1fa22e05173439cda80d5bf1760b10f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed853b1c90c3b65d34fce542",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战“居中”赢得日本德比和天皇赏（秋）\\n并且在育成结束时拥有“切れ者”(能人)育成状态",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8d61d5aeb98a4434c20d8b0241ca5744219e50fb0f2d759b7126b8f4551fd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0185988a3dd435643965ccba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以人气第1于弥生赏、皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏取得胜利，\\n并于有马纪念（经典级）取得胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到240000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b91e4025e452d315505a0be4bb8a903497ff5e7629e0728789dac407684bbe1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d7645af079bf1189d38d9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从育成等级[S]以上的赛马娘身上继承心意，\\n以无败状态于希望锦标、弥生赏、皋月赏取得胜利，\\n并且属性[速度]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c13052277cf94699640295fc74a40085e8c8bae0aa616ba5297f9ee91e92681",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b7dc48f3453fdd2108c47e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得7次GⅠ级别比赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f142247e81d4b6b1f16b55c50959e30fbda9684f59bc87b0ef9375d8b57dc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae0167c623d49ad458180a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉丝数量达到55万人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f90e2b1b2370648ca6278171ee25953edd2a2763f838371f5a5d412f973ca19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1d5ee3e428e80ae82ec1000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得高松宫纪念、短途马锦标、\\n安田纪念、英里冠军赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e2e3f1fc06949f15e8937c95cdc90b2988360c290f220b7732fefc450561d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9801941f2046288aee76ace1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在包括天皇赏(春)、宝冢纪念、天皇赏(秋)、\\n日本杯、有马纪念的重赏中取得8次以上连胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "35dbd1947659b4ae309e8b2691d73e0f04e772dac038f8052e28e9b14d03bcbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "51"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676d5a27789693daf6f8a28a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "1185c0982bcbbd95831bcb80515cc11fca8f24cea48bc3818895e7343e01e840",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6cd50283fbba145c6834c1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胜率85%以上，\\n并取得GⅠ级别比赛的胜利达到7次以上，且粉丝数达到32万人以上完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "de4c58444f6a6abf8a42c26f62c4e1be1eae8fe405ed6d0a9efe4d53ed3e604b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc98a356153f12d14d3e8e54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持连胜的状态下取得GⅠ级别比赛7胜以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "5361e9070d37ab92f0817c7400703e3f8da37fcb8fe089e80d6768f4a6ce85fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5c17cbea3c84d1c371a8a1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在干劲为“绝不调”的状态下，取得GⅠ级别比赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a3fe59b7a106baaef395611a73fc11798ef7c1f37a9e93b1d1f4ae0867367f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:366535ea4b5bfd68926ce2c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在1400m以下的重赏中取得胜利7次以上，\\n且属性[速度][力量]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e14930f27c8595b08eb95f91a0bdac9b209832837bce3777d11be6dd0787a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11f6a35b7661ffad1941027e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2400m以上的重赏中取得7胜，\\n并且属性[耐力]达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "c102f3c6542149637a44101aa9c04754f479cdce4aeb4476d1244ea187f84d07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "58"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dc7dbd60a682f551c03fedb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2400m以上的GⅠ级别比赛中取得4次胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "114a8a3d2a81d56a710c9f2be3fe7004907ff78e93cc0030fb29933f81bddbc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "59"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eef6ae1639782fc645c94f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加10场以上比赛，\\n并在只参加沙土比赛的状态完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4899a50650de15087cc5f91b430e65ccc98e446c0dc11c2f68089b04532c985",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7e16d7c73b17e84ac96ee4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在GⅠ级别的英里赛中以5马身以上的差距取得3次胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a7648b843f593c3bfbd812019fd1371586725073b55a597ade0387a76cd56d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e17d27f4d20186c33eedaeed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加比赛12次以上，并以全胜的状态完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "081c31d3dcd39246849b782096752fcfd734ed057433922e67924bc501dfb3dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "61"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0236f985ac671eb9f6d3f36b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以人气6-9名的情况下取得重赏比赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "94b70e476f3248e882e9635fd8cf74d993962bff5f70e9bdd79585e87c50ca0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "62"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8213709a2b3eef46df76078",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于GⅠ取得5次以上胜利，并赢得URA总决赛\\n且粉丝数达到320000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae39bb36b296d045c3a7d379139b78346106296566fda65695489aa6a57d72ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:834e9a202d46ead3e608a7cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "学习20个技能以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1831270d7805a3709252e53497e52e113049ba22fffea9ba6badcc894f1308",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4338ede86b46f275ed8d2834",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在一次比赛中发动13次以上技能",
      "source_fingerprint": "688db342469529e4a85092ab4b5df6cd61d7fc684f0789113e93c346868fed4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b9654c429c232122d9d53f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在人气第一的情况下以5马身以上的差距取得日本德比的胜利，\\n并取得天皇赏(春)、天皇赏(秋)、日本杯的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c02b2ab9d90e6a9507577f7937c4d839e10e65813158ad8d13ae28976da4999",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6431ce3f23c0f1aea5ac7a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在人气第一的情况下使用作战【领放】保持连胜且在重赏中取得6胜，\\n其中在宝冢纪念从起跑200m开始保持第1直到比赛结束",
      "source_fingerprint": "bed72ef0321dde673f3eaca71a7accf810a3da7b17a33eb7937033c90285dcc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "67"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52edb211543f6e262425bf20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "全部比赛都在前二，\\n且使用作战[先行]取得日本杯(第二年)的胜利，粉丝数达到32w以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa4f8fee683f764334a74980b7dc80853f116ac424903482ee0b038de36b87f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "68"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7127e3a59adfe223ae0f1489",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在无败的情况下取得8次以上连胜，并以平均7马身以上的差距取得胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "76740965157c8ae40675fe2b42bbbcd3cf9118b8281487edfb03f308dbc6786e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "69"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1618e5dcc6f7ab3caf6498",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加10场以上比赛，\\n并在只参加草地比赛的状态完成育成",
      "source_fingerprint": "c199e86e73ef393694f8d28fd7f69d71db3905a945fa0ae01c60317ad5a05258",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd489350800fc6c7a52209d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战[领放][先行][居中][追赶]分别取得GⅠ级别比赛的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd54bcac844e80a1e51d2e488c0f5e697c49d8c4382184c340d61bfe151d97c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976d8ca5a37e53a8efc5b95f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在草地与沙土的GⅠ级别比赛中各获得3次以上胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8eee41b259b8028b6c80f37171294e5b24f90488cffcf0104397c5aec34c3f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "71"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27806783b0b1e7fa6395aa6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以5马身以上差距赢得菊花赏，\\n并于包含天皇赏（春）的2400m以上主要比赛中获胜6次",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e2d14d2e55e994c43a1c87ee6f6c741a68bfa415691ae956dfcf0ed0f93c92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2f7946707062f1798d2396",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在干劲[好调]以下的状态取得朝日杯未来锦标、有马纪念(第二年)、\\n宝冢纪念(第三年)、有马纪念(第三年)的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e478c7596115277758daa55c008d0474f1c6912dc7ae83c43ef5849628186b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "73"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847780f92335c4880ed1aad7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在包括日本德比、安田纪念、日本杯、天皇赏(秋)、\\n维多利亚英里赛的GⅠ级别比赛中取得7次以上胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "100978b3b3b8b8f3504090c958ff0b7e325286a98a5a3a0e1efcf2da518edcce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15862b2d0984ea162a79a082",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从育成过程中曾于皋月赏获胜的赛马娘身上继承心意，\\n赢得包含樱花赏、秋华赏、伊丽莎白女王杯的10次重赏比赛，\\n并且每场竞赛成绩都在前两名以内",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a77f174416176d2dfef4b985b4255369928e47661ca790c02147f3d05880ac3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b00d7ef6dec92ec8322ba19",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从育成过程中曾于GⅠ获胜7次以上的赛马娘身上继承心意，\\n并以人气第1于GⅠ胜利4次以上，其中须以无败状态赢得皋月赏\\n及日本德比，并且需于有马纪念（古马级）中获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "b157573323ad7b9c648fbcf651367ac5af692343862acee9e1a25e3153547ad1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6e0dafea17a307b22f85af4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在包括皋月赏、菊花赏、宝冢纪念的GⅠ级别比赛中取得胜利6次以上，\\n且粉丝数达到48万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ec01a2cebfeb028be2da2f03199f93d5ff1f7d6006691454f80329ce2a1146",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "77"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3820bd92c51c29baf8dd0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在无败的情况下取得皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏的胜利，\\n并取得日本杯、天皇赏(春)及两次有马纪念的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de001cff02664ee53251c7094b5c0b6ed913a81080a4df22d863216ddcd7433",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d46eadaa73127df6727327",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持干劲在【绝好调】的状态出战GⅡ或GⅠ级别比赛15次以上，\\n在包括菊花赏的GⅡ以上赛事中取得3连胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c94ac2d832ca11f46e3e6aef3ed1c95b375c7b01bdb3e6d0028c03239e7690",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "79"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fabd1ed50d8948e19ffcf4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在发生了焦躁的比赛中取得三次胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ded27647282fb63971b24c8ef077b7cb6db8ed1724c415684e68af2d4ee2496",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7f5e00c2d9670c9527142e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在出道战以8马身差以上取胜，\\n并以人气第1取得朝日杯未来锦标、皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "b41460bf289a1228df76c780b272a3d45b1f1bf4f2c8d0787cba055cb7440453",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c6ede90428f9e150d5e967",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在GⅠ级别比赛中取得三次第三名，且粉丝数达到32万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb20fc770fc0fb42f4e4755956308ba05bf43b4f73f698298865d75e50e66fa5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "81"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfea039fa1ff6c78f54819db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拥有目白之名的赛马娘取得一次以上GⅠ级别比赛的胜利，\\n并取得菊花赏、宝冢纪念、有马纪念的胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到24万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "cab1401794061dc7db7a79ad8d1236675dfe32df69813b3151593cc74a394024",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "82"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8693c05be650a5df82bd5f57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在包括独角兽锦标、安田纪念的英里重赏比赛中取得5次以上胜利，\\n其中有1次以上是雨天，\\n并在英里冠军赛中以5马身以上差距取得胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e493a5f984580ace36deea4fd002e12ad144db9f9c9df688df7cb3ebcf05ab2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "83"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:223ef12b397b2bfc5848403a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加GⅠ级别比赛获得人气第一6次以上，\\n并取得英里冠军赛、安田纪念、有马纪念胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到24万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "d77ba37393a9ef2f266c7da10008ee2257dea7bebef7dc6c7b45dec96d6915eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "84"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5639cd1676eb2115ded55a5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战「追赶」且以人气第1保持连胜并取得重赏比赛6胜以上，\\n其中至少要有2场在最终直线超越5人以上取胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "36bb4a8c87ef2f2a10cb28d611578d69611f0a86286c5c7dc448ff70730cedf5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "85"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7dae5fe5e02bd720af8634a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持连胜并在包括天皇赏(春)、宝冢纪念、天皇赏(秋)、\\n日本杯、有马纪念的重赏中取得8次以上胜利",
